<title>INDIA: India EID Parry 96/97 results on May 22.</title>
<headline>India EID Parry 96/97 results on May 22.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of EID Parry (India) Ltd will meet on May 22 to finalise accounts for the year ending March 31, 1997, the firm said on Friday in a statement to the Bombay Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The fertiliser and pesticides firm had raised $40 million through an issue of global depositary receipts in 1994.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
